      "hub_id": 2611,
      "guid": "com.sp-tarkov.deadwolf.betterattachments",
      "name": "BETTER ATTACHMENTS",
      "slug": "better-attachments",
      "teaser": "All gun attachments are better ergonomics and confgurable recoils. To deal with OP AIs you need OP guns.",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2611.png",
      "downloads": 24187,
      "favourites_count": 19,
      "description": "<p>All gun attachments are changed and fully configurable. This includes:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Stocks</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Foregrips</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Sights (all types) - Iron Sights, Collimator, Compact Collimator, Optical Sights, Scopes etc.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Muzzles (all types) - Compensator, Flashhider, Suppressors etc.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Flashlights</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Lasers</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Handguards</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Pistol Grips</p>\n<p><strong>Total number of attachments changed: 1094</strong></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Silencers and Flashhiders are buffed. Which makes Guns OP with Perfect Ergonomics. To avoid this please use Config file to balance it. IMO -&gt; OP AIs need OP Guns.</p>\n<p><strong>Installations</strong></p>\n<p>Copy the SPT folder into your SP Tarkov Root Folder. The BetterAttachments Folder will automatically Placed in &lt;SPT-ROOT&gt;/SPT/user/mods</p>\n<p><strong>Improvements:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Ergonomics improved by ~50%</li>\n<li>Recoil improved by ~25%</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Everything provided in the mod is configurable. Just update ergonomics_updated and recoil_updated value inside the config file whatever you want.</p>\n",
